      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]『ううう……\\nやっぱり　いるのかよ……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0800_rival_02",
      "hash": "3ce297f45c19aa38",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "え！？\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]　なにソレ！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0800_sys_01",
      "hash": "2da7b102b7cc111a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "シルフスコープが　ゆうれいの\\nしょうたいを　みやぶった！"
